# Commands and results

- `.venv/bin/python -m pytest agent/tests -q` -> `1137 passed, 1 skipped`. Covers
  the governed READ context implementation across all 9 tasks: typed Frame/Slot/
  Pending contracts and legacy migration (Task 1), deterministic candidate
  extraction and semantic validation (Task 2), the pure `ContextReducer` (Task 3),
  the fail-closed decision gate (Task 4), Registry/Gateway pattern discard
  (Task 5), durable Session v2 lease/CAS/turn-idempotency (Task 6), authoritative
  Frame v2 and unified pending interactions (Task 7), the 13-fixture governed
  multi-turn Eval harness (Task 8), and the narrowed `READ_CONTEXT_MODE`
  restriction plus its contract test (Task 9).
- `cd services/gateway && ./gradlew :core:test :app:test` -> `BUILD SUCCESSFUL`.
  Covers Registry-declared READ input-pattern validation
  (`CapabilityRegistryValidatorTest`, `CapabilityValidationServiceTest`) that
  rejects `plant=工厂` before SAP and accepts `5100`/`1000`.
- `npm --prefix frontend run release-gate -- --profile all` ->
  `target=L3`, `targetPassed=true`, `caseTotals={total:22, passed:22, failed:0,
  missing:0, skipped:0, stale:0}`, `registrySnapshotId=snapshot-release-gate`,
  `fixtureVersion=1.1.0`, `modelRecordingVersion=1.1.0`,
  `liveSmoke.status=not_run`. Full report:
  `runtime/evals/results/agent-release-l3-2026-08-07T10-05-05-768Z.json`.
  Exercises the non-compensable hard gates added in Task 8 (aggregate
  exact-total evidence check across all 13 `context-*` fixture cases:
  `contextConflictCases=9`, `nonReadyFrames=10`, `callPlanSlotChecks=20`) and
  the durable CAS/lease/duplicate-turn/READ-write-isolation probes.
- `npm --prefix frontend run typecheck` -> exit `0`.
- `openspec list --json` / `openspec validate --all --strict` -> `20/20` pass.
- `git diff --check` -> clean.
- `.venv/bin/python -m pytest agent/tests/test_orchestrator.py -q` -> `114
  passed`, including the Task 9 contract test proving the governed READ path
  never reaches `llm_intent.resolve_with_context` (reachability sanity check
  plus a direct `last_context is None` invariant assertion after every turn).

# Skipped checks

- Live LLM and live SAP READ smoke: intentionally not run per the plan's
  Global Constraints ("do not run a live LLM or live SAP READ smoke
  automatically"); `liveSmoke.status=not_run` in every release-gate report.
